msgstr "Online"

msgid ""
"Please note that creating a file system on a Bcache device can take longer. "
"It is therefore possible that the file system is not immediately available "
"for mounting."
msgstr ""
"Det kan ta längre tid att skapa ett filsystem på en bcache-enhet. Därför kan"
" det dröja innan filsystemet går att montera."

